  "description": "The Bintelli Fusion is the first of its kind! A hybrid vehicle combining the ease of owning an electric bicycle (no registration, license, or insurance required) with all of the amazing features of a scooter (headlight, taillight, brake light, turn signal, horn, and comfortable seat)! With the Bintelli Fusion, you will be the talk of the town! Not only can you cruise up to 20 mph, but the Fusion has been designed to use on- or off-road! Its rugged tires are great for the beach or on your local trails! A Bintelli exclusive, the Fusion will be the most fun you have ever had on an “e-bike!”",
